  "_doc": "Slug -> USDA ERS Food Availability (per-capita) commodity. The VOLUME cross-check for the value-based reliance seam: how many lbs/person/yr of this commodity are available domestically (production + imports - exports - loss-side uses, per ERS). Per-capita availability is published at the COMMODITY level, so a variety/cut maps to its parent commodity (scope=commodity) and the figure is labeled as the commodity per-capita, never the exact cut. Descriptive of the tracked ERS series, never a forecast; lbs available, never a price.",
